From ca91bdbf6aeeb7c29d8eb0775087ca253ec02c2c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Pelenitsyn <a.pelenitsyn@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:06:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] Compress the programs that mhs builds, as MicroCabal
 does

mcabal passes -z to mhs for every executable it builds, and MicroHs's
Makefile passes it for mhs itself, which makes mhs compress the combinator
code of the program. Cabal now passes it too, so that, built with cabal,
mhs is the size it is built with the Makefile, 526,864 bytes rather than
1,104,400, and builds no slower. Libraries are not affected, as mhs always
compresses package files.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0176vAefrw8jPKXdh9h1wKuj
---
 Cabal/src/Distribution/Simple/MHS.hs | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Cabal/src/Distribution/Simple/MHS.hs b/Cabal/src/Distribution/Simple/MHS.hs
index fc7145f58..99c550949 100644
--- a/Cabal/src/Distribution/Simple/MHS.hs
+++ b/Cabal/src/Distribution/Simple/MHS.hs
@@ -592,7 +592,9 @@ buildExe verbosity pkg_descr lbi exe clbi = do
   srcMainPath <- findFileCwd verbosity (mbWorkDirLBI lbi) (sourceDirs bi) (modulePath exe)
   createDirectoryIfMissingVerbose verbosity True (interpretSymbolicPathLBI lbi targetDir)
   runMhs verbosity pkg_descr lbi bi clbi $
-    map u (cSources bi)
+    -- Compress the combinator code of the program, as MicroCabal does.
+    ["-z"]
+      ++ map u (cSources bi)
       ++ concat [["-optc", opt] | opt <- ccOptions bi]
       ++ ["-o", u exeFile, u srcMainPath]
 
